arding the utilization of proceeds from its Rights Issue for the quarter ended September 30, 2026. Crisil Ratings Limited issued the report. The Rights Issue size was up to Rs 40,990.50 lakh. Proceeds were utilized for working capital and issue expenses. Rs 20,978.96 lakh was utilized. Rs 20,011.54 lakh remains unutilized. Unutilized funds are invested in fixed deposits with HDFC Bank. The return on investment is 6.90 percent. There were no deviations from the objects disclosed in the Offer Document. The company confirmed that general corporate purposes funds will be utilized in subsequent quarters.", "voiceUrl": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.in/ann_voice/ETHOS_14112026143533_Monitoring_Agency_Report_Rights_Issue.mp3"}, {"an_dt": "12-Nov-2026 19:55:35", "attFileSize": "7.07 MB", "attchmntFile": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.in/corporate/ETHOS_12112026195523_Investor_Presentation_.pdf", "attchmntText": "Ethos Limited has informed the Exchange about Investor Presentation", "bflag": null, "csvName": null, "desc": "Investor Presentation", "difference": "00:00:01", "dt": "12112026195535", "exchdisstime": "12-Nov-2026 19:55:36", "fileSize": "7.07 MB", "hasXbrl": true, "old_new": null, "orgid": null, "seq_id": "106857598", "smIndustry": null, "sm_isin": "INE04TZ01018", "sm_name": "Ethos Limited", "sort_date": "2026-11-12 19:55:35", "symbol": "ETHOSLTD", "voiceSummary": null, "voiceUrl": null}, {"an_dt": "12-Nov-2026 19:38:46", "attFileSize": "989.75 KB", "attchmntFile": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.in/corporate/ETHOS_12112026193838_RightsIssue.pdf", "attchmntText": "Ethos Limited has informed the Exchange about statement of deviation(s) or variation(s) under Reg. 32", "bflag": null, "csvName": null, "desc": "Statement of deviation(s) or variation(s) under Reg. 32", "difference": "00:00:01", "dt": "12112026193846", "exchdisstime": "12-Nov-2026 19:38:47", "fileSize": "989.75 KB", "hasXbrl": true, "old_new": null, "orgid": null, "seq_id": "106857561", "smIndustry": null, "sm